{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u231bCORE MECHANICS\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bImprint System\u200b</strong>\u200b: Use a &quot;Chronocamera&quot; (Imprint Sphere) to \u200b<strong>\u200brecord/rewind\u200b</strong>\u200b objects' states (position, switches, motion) and crack mind-bending puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bMechanic Analogy\u200b</strong>\u200b: Think of it as a \u200b<strong>\u200btemporal camera\u200b</strong>\u200b:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSnapshot (Imprint)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Target objects (doors, lasers, machinery) to save their current state (position, rotation, activation, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bReview (Rewind)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Reload &quot;temporal snapshots&quot; to undo mistakes or forge new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bDynamic State Chains\u200b</strong>\u200b: Manipulate multi-object synergies (e.g., &quot;1-switch controls 2 gates&quot;) and predict \u200b<strong>\u200bchain reactions\u200b</strong>\u200b.<br>\u200b<strong>\u200bNegation Rules\u200b</strong>\u200b: Rewinding a &quot;recorded ON state&quot; after disabling its controller triggers \u200b<strong>\u200blogic inversion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200b<strong>\u200b\ud83c\udf00KEY FEATURES\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<br>\u200b<strong>\u200b\ud83d\udd2eMinimalist Sci-Fi Aesthetics\u200b</strong>\u200b: Cyberpunk neon glows and industrial textures\u2014zero visual clutter.<br>\u200b<strong>\u200b\u2699\ufe0fPure Mechanic-Driven Design\u200b</strong>\u200b: <i>&quot;No tutorials. No compromises.&quot;</i> Progress from single-object puzzles to \u200b<strong>\u200btemporal matrixes\u200b</strong>\u200b with escalating complexity.<br>\u200b<strong>\u200b\ud83c\udfc6Speedrun &amp; Strategy\u200b</strong>\u200b: Chase &quot;Zero Imprint&quot; achievements and claim the \u200b<strong>\u200bSSS Chronoarchitect</strong>\u200b title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u200b<strong>\u200bPublic Test Version Coming Soon\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>\u200b<strong>\u200b\u231b Enter the Temporal Ruins. Prove Your Mastery.\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>\u200b<strong>\u200b&quot;Test version includes first 5 chapters\u2014Wishlist Now!&quot;</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678770?t=1746323212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678770/1749b12b818f721ae76793b79510a679b4f32b67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746323212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678770/f89f6372111f326d30ec31c7051be3581ac626bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746323212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678770/f89f6372111f326d30ec31c7051be3581ac626bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746323212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u231bCORE MECHANICS\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bImprint System\u200b</strong>\u200b: Use a &quot;Chronocamera&quot; (Imprint Sphere) to \u200b<strong>\u200brecord/rewind\u200b</strong>\u200b objects' states (position, switches, motion) and crack mind-bending puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bMechanic Analogy\u200b</strong>\u200b: Think of it as a \u200b<strong>\u200btemporal camera\u200b</strong>\u200b:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bSnapshot (Imprint)\u200b</strong>\u200b: Target objects (doors, lasers, machinery) to save their current state (position, rotation, activation, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<s